    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prison Escape.io is a multiplayer escape game where you race against time to outsmart guards, dodge tricky traps, and break free from confinement. Team up with friends or compete in wild multiplayer challenges. Every second counts as you run, jump, and strategize your way through daring escapes packed with surprises and nonstop excitement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect shiny coins, unlock fun outfits, and use awesome power-ups to boost your escape. Every level is packed with surprises\u2014are you fast, smart, and brave enough to make it out?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583470/extras/335c887f9dc6e0612bfcd0cc0e580be4.poster.avif?t=1755383649\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583470/extras/335c887f9dc6e0612bfcd0cc0e580be4.webm?t=1755383649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583470/extras/335c887f9dc6e0612bfcd0cc0e580be4.mp4?t=1755383649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc6e Prison Break \u2013 Escape the big prison with your team or race solo! Be sneaky, be quick, and don't get caught!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d Glass Bridge \u2013 Step on the right glass or fall down! Trust your team\u2014or take the risky leap on your own!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 HexaGone \u2013 The floor disappears under your feet\u2014stay on the platforms as long as you can! Last one standing wins!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude82 RailWay \u2013 Jump between fast-moving trains and dodge obstacles. Can you make it to the finish line without falling?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf08 Obby Rainbow (Coming soon) \u2013 A super colorful obstacle tower! Climb with your friends or challenge them to reach the top first!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583470/extras/2f0fdab507bad9b92d168f67857a60e7.poster.avif?t=1755383649\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583470/extras/2f0fdab507bad9b92d168f67857a60e7.webm?t=1755383649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583470/extras/2f0fdab507bad9b92d168f67857a60e7.mp4?t=1755383649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad Pick Your Character \u2013 Choose from tons of silly and cool characters to match your style!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 Power-Ups \u2013 Speed boosts, shields, and more to help you win!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf81 Daily Rewards \u2013 Come back every day to get fun gifts and coins!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d New Worlds \u2013 Explore exciting new places with your friends. Each level is like a brand-new game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc6b Made for Multiplayer \u2013 Play with your squad or challenge others in real-time!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583470/extras/c10c412b50d56cd4abfe2dcc6059fd02.poster.avif?t=1755383649\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583470/extras/c10c412b50d56cd4abfe2dcc6059fd02.webm?t=1755383649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583470/extras/c10c412b50d56cd4abfe2dcc6059fd02.mp4?t=1755383649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
